{"version":1,"content":"<p>英特爾行政總裁陳立武（Lip-Bu Tan）近日表示，人工智能的發展勢頭遠未達到頂峯，其未來影響力甚至有可能超過互聯網。然而，在AI快速擴張的過程中，行業正面臨一系列關鍵瓶頸，其中最值得關注的挑戰之一是如何確保未來數十億乃至更多AI代理（AI Agents）不會執行未經授權的操作。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585000.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:38.815096+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:06:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:26.139257+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:26.139257+00:00","content_hash":"aa0a6106614542ff786b10f631f50ef888df72310348542098e4e09e29a2ea62","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}